    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "Stumbled on this issue, do you care about it?\n\nCuPy has little understanding of dtype parameters in general right now.  I moved some code around in a current PR, which would cause an error to be raised instead.\n\n(Making this work isn't implausible, but I think better structured dtype support or similar a better reason to push it than byte swapping.)",
